node_modules/
.turbo/
dist/
*.log
.DS_Store
.cursor/

# Secretos. `evals/agent/` lee ANTHROPIC_API_KEY y OPENAI_API_KEY del entorno, así que un `.env`
# acá tiene claves reales adentro. Hoy no existe ninguno y nunca se commiteó uno (verificado sobre
# todo el historial), y esta regla es para que siga siendo cierto: la primera vez que alguien cree
# uno va a ser mientras debuggea algo, que es exactamente cuando no se mira `git status`.
# `.env.example` queda FUERA del ignore a propósito: documenta qué variables hacen falta sin
# llevar valores, y es lo que debería commitearse en su lugar.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# The production build `build-preview-heights.mjs` measures against. Rebuilt by the script itself,
# never read by anything else, and ~800 pages of HTML: the measurements it produces are what gets
# committed (`artifacts/preview-heights.json`), not the site they were taken from.
packages/ai-gates/scripts/.preview-heights-dist/

# Playwright run output. The BASELINE is committed (src/**/*-snapshots); this is the diff of a run.
test-results/

# Handoff note for the in-flight demo → usage-tree porting. Temporary by design: delete it when the
# porting lands. What outlives it belongs in docs/ai-ui-platform.md, F6.
PORTING-DEMOS.md

# Scratch harnesses for that same porting: they check a page's stages rather than the product, and
# PORTING-DEMOS.md carries the copy that matters. Delete them with it.
# The glob, not the bare name: these borrow Playwright from packages/ai-gates, so a per-page copy
# has to sit inside the repo to resolve it, and everyone porting a page makes one.
verify-stages*.mjs
shot-stages*.mjs
apps/docs/check-trees.mts

# The dev server writes its own PID and port here on every run. Tracked once by accident, and
# stripped out of every commit by hand since, which is a chore that only ever ends one way.
apps/docs/.astro/dev.json

# Output of evals/run-agent.ts: one folder per run, read locally in apps/eval-viewer or a plain
# editor. It's a measurement of THIS run against the current catalogue, not a fixture to keep.
evals/agent/runs/

